    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>29级 杂兵 控制</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +24</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 43，''强韧'' 39，''反射'' 41，''意志'' 42</span><span>''侦查'' +22</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}胆怯之触✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+32vs.意志<br>命中：15 点伤害，且目标移动其速度的格数远离该堕落胆小鬼，尽可能避开危险。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">报应恐惧</div>\n<div class=description>触发：一个敌人使该堕落胆小鬼的生命值降到 0。<br>效果（无动作）：触发的敌人移动其速度的格数远离其最近的敌人。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">（堕落贪吃鬼，堕落商鬼）</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">魔鬼，地狱骑士 DEVIL,HELL KNIGHT</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（堕落疯鬼）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 20（+19）</span><span>''敏捷'' 30（+24）</span><span>''感知'' 26（+22）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 26（+22）</span><span>''智力'' 14（+16）</span><span>''魅力'' 17（+17）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语</span></div></div>\n</div>",
